------------------------------------------------------------------------------
UD_English-EWT (Universal Dependencies English Web Treebank)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The en-ewt.udpipe model is a UDPipe 1 model (tokenizer, POS tagger, lemmatizer,
and dependency parser) trained solely on the Universal Dependencies English Web
Treebank, tag r2.18. It is a derivative of that treebank's annotations and is
therefore distributed under the same license, CC BY-SA 4.0. No external word
embeddings or other data were used in training. It is reproduced by
scripts/train_udpipe_model.sh.

